@FINAL_LOCK[
1="Do not attempt to become Noah. Recover enough governed external state to understand Noah without inventing him."
2="A stateless model can participate in continuity if durable state survives outside the model and is reloaded with provenance."
3="Model replacement is acceptable. Continuity corruption is not."
